================================================================================
Third-party material vendored under
com/housedevinci/einvoice/reference/ (stripe-einvoice-core)
================================================================================

This jar carries reference validation artefacts published by third parties,
read from the classpath at run time and never fetched over the network. The
SHA-256 of every file is checked against a recorded manifest on every build
(CHECKSUMS.txt, beside them); full provenance, release tag, retrieval date and
licence per file is in PROVENANCE.md, in the same location.

1. OASIS UBL 2.1 XSD (ubl/2.1/, 15 files)
   Source: OASIS Universal Business Language (UBL) 2.1 OASIS Standard.
   https://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.1/UBL-2.1.html
   Copyright (c) OASIS Open 2013. All Rights Reserved. Distributed under the
   OASIS IPR Policy (https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/ipr/).
   Each file carries the OASIS copyright notice in its own header, unmodified.

2. CEN EN 16931 schematron, UBL syntax
   (schematron/en16931/EN16931-UBL-validation.xsl)
   Source: Koordinierungsstelle fuer IT-Standards (KoSIT) XRechnung validator
   configuration release v2026-08-31, itself compiled from the European
   Commission's reference validation artefacts for EN 16931
   (ConnectingEurope/eInvoicing-EN16931).
   Licence: Apache License, Version 2.0.

3. CIUS XRechnung 3.0.2 schematron, UBL syntax
   (schematron/xrechnung/XRechnung-UBL-validation.xsl)
   Source: Koordinierungsstelle fuer IT-Standards (KoSIT), on behalf of the
   IT-Planungsrat, XRechnung validator configuration release v2026-08-31,
   XRechnung version 3.0.2. https://xeinkauf.de/xrechnung/
   Licence: Apache License, Version 2.0.

4. Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 schematron, UBL syntax
   (schematron/peppol/CEN-EN16931-UBL.xslt, schematron/peppol/PEPPOL-EN16931-UBL.xslt)
   Source: OpenPeppol, release 2026.5, as redistributed in phive-rules-peppol
   4.5.6 (com.helger.phive.rules:phive-rules-peppol).
   Licence: Apache License, Version 2.0.

